 2022\">superettan 2022</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Städer_och_arenor\"><span id=\"St.C3.A4der_och_arenor\"></span>Städer och arenor</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2023&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Städer och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2023&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Städer och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"130\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"140\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Ort\n</th>\n<th width=\"130\">Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2022\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\"><img alt=\"Stockholms län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-Stockholm_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholms_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Stockholms län\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Friends_Arena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fr